77
00:03:58,720 --> 00:03:59,500
That's right!

78
00:03:59,780 --> 00:04:01,000
I knew she looked familiar.

79
00:04:01,140 --> 00:04:02,800
She comes to see our shows all the time.

80
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:11,780
You're that girl with the glasses who's always in the crowd!

81
00:04:11,780 --> 00:04:15,360
