91
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:38,420
Oh, please don't worry.

92
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:41,660
I mean, you guys do look pretty sickly and banged up right now.

93
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:44,740
But during a show, nobody would ever notice you're not alive.

94
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:47,880
You always look so cute and beautiful when you're performing.

95
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,400
Is that all just makeup?

96
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:51,600
She's taking this like a champ.

97
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:54,760
Maybe zombies just aren't all that shocking anymore.

98
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,240
Except you got shot.

99
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,400
