109
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,460
You guys should let me be a part of Ron Shushu.

110
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:21,180
Huh?

111
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,420
It'll be way easier to keep the secret if I'm in the group, right?

112
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,240
What do you mean?

113
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:29,060
My, aren't you a bold one.

114
00:05:29,540 --> 00:05:30,840
