129
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,320
Well, it's almost curfew for me.

130
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:09,420
See you tomorrow.

131
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:10,440
Bye!

132
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:14,760
So she's gonna commute instead of staying here.

133
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:15,980
That's an option?

134
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:17,240
What the hell?

135
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:19,720
Ha-ha!

136
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:20,340
Ugh!

137
00:06:21,740 --> 00:06:22,740
Hey, Mai Mai!

138
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:24,860
Let's go get some frozen tapioca!

139
