Sorry.

140
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,240
I'll have to say tapinoka.

141
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,380
Aw, man.

142
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,460
I didn't know you had festival stuff today.

143
00:06:30,860 --> 00:06:33,060
Actually, it's something way cooler than the festival.

144
00:06:33,460 --> 00:06:36,060
Wait, if Mai Mai's bailing on tapioca, then...

145
00:06:36,060 --> 00:06:36,500
Hold on!

146
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:37,820
Do you have a hot date or something?

147
00:06:37,820 --> 00:06:38,680
Tell us now!

148
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,640
Not in the romantic sense.

149
00:06:40,780 --> 00:06:42,700
But it is a crucial rendezvous.

150
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:44,940
Good morning, girls!

151
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:46,420
Mai Mai reporting in!

152
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:50,080
Are you dead serious about becoming an idol?

153
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,200
That's the grave!

154
00:06:51,420 --> 00:06:52,880
And you may know our secret,

155
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:54,980
but you can't use that against us.

156
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:56,120
I wouldn't dare.

157
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:00,920
Fair enough.

158
00:07:02,660 --> 00:07:05,220
So Mai Mai, do you have any dance experience?

159
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:07,920
Nope, afraid I will be starting off at zero.

160
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,880
But I do have all of the lyrics and routines

161
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:11,660
