394
00:16:00,660 --> 00:16:01,780
Hang on a sec!

395
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:03,920
Did you forget something?

396
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:05,660
You know, me?

397
00:16:05,660 --> 00:16:15,560
My, Mai, don't worry.

398
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:17,420
You've practiced hard for this show.

399
00:16:18,420 --> 00:16:19,640
Yeah, sweet!

